C/ Named-list CANCEL (`CANCEL A, B;`) of two still-DORMANT cyclic tasks --
C/ both are removed before initiating, neither runs.  Exercises the multi-
C/ name operand-list form (CANC.md's previously-untested list form).
C/ Expected: BEFORE / DONE (neither "IN A" nor "IN B").
 TCANNAM: PROGRAM;
    A: TASK;
       WRITE(6) 'IN A';
    CLOSE A;
    B: TASK;
       WRITE(6) 'IN B';
    CLOSE B;
    WRITE(6) 'BEFORE';
    SCHEDULE A PRIORITY(80), REPEAT EVERY 1.0;
    SCHEDULE B PRIORITY(80), REPEAT EVERY 1.0;
    CANCEL A, B;
    WAIT 1.0;
    WRITE(6) 'DONE';
 CLOSE TCANNAM;
